WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.580
Holding his breath.

2
00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:03.700
Standing for hours.

3
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:06.180
Living on almost no food.

4
00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:10.370
For six years Siddhattha pushed
his body harder than anyone,

5
00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:12.780
with five companions beside him.

6
00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:17.050
In his own later account, he could
feel his spine through his stomach.

7
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.740
He nearly died.

8
00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:22.370
So why did he stop, and
what did he find instead?

9
00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:27.040
In this mission, you'll follow him to
one night beneath a tree at Bodh Gaya.

10
00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:31.490
Then you'll see how five old companions
became the first community of Buddhist

11
00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:32.560
monks.

12
00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:36.740
Your mission: find out why
Siddhattha gave up starving himself,

13
00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:38.350
and what he found instead.
